# UI stack (RSC + MUI + Tailwind)

## Structure

- Pages: Server Components in `src/app/pages/`
- Interactive forms / state: small `"use client"` files under `src/app/components/` (see `home-form.tsx`)
- Document shell: `src/app/document.tsx` — stylesheet via `?url` for RSC HTML
- Theme: `src/app/theme.ts` + `src/app/providers.tsx` (MUI `ThemeProvider`, Emotion cache)
- Styles: `src/app/styles.css` (Tailwind + MUI CSS layers), linked from `Document` via `?url`

## Styling

- **Tailwind** for layout, spacing, and page chrome
- **MUI** for components — import from `@mui/material/Button` etc. (not barrel imports)
- Use `className` on MUI roots and `slotProps` for inner slots when Tailwind overrides are needed

## Patterns

- Server page + client form: `src/app/pages/home.tsx` + `src/app/components/home-form.tsx`
- Presentational + interactive card: `src/app/components/feature-card.tsx`

## Routes

Register new pages in `src/worker.tsx` with `route()` like the home page.
